| F4 | open | SUGGESTION | flutter_app/lib/ui/widgets/wide_layout_shell.dart | 💡 suggestion files presentation doesn t auto collapse the chats list — only js apps do collapsesidebarforduopresentation added in this pr guards on apppresentation null and returns early the files surface sets filespresentation and apppresentation null in openfiles before calling presentsurface so on expanded duo opening a js app docks right and auto collapses the chats list new test duo docks the app right collapses the chats list and restores it on close pins this opening files docks right but the chats list stays expanded beside it the pr description covers both surfaces in one contract expanded duo presents js apps and files docked at the window s right edge … the chats list auto collapses when an app opens and restores on close minimize a reader expects the same presentation run for files either collapse for files too the same save restore mechanism already handles it — dismisspresentedsurface restores or scope the documented contract to js apps explicitly so the behavior is intentional |

### How to answer

Add a `findingReview` block to `outputs/pr_review.json` (alongside `inlineComments`):

```json
{"findingReview": {
  "dispositions": [
    {"n": 1, "status": "fixed", "hunk": "<file:lines \u2014 the fixing hunk>"},
    {"n": 2, "status": "withdrawn", "reason": "<why this is not a defect>"},
    {"n": 3, "status": "re-introduced"}
  ],
  "confirmations": [
    {"proposedFor": 1, "same": true}
  ]
}}
```

Unconfirmed candidates become new identities (the merge bias is confirm-only); a genuinely new finding on a resolved item is expected to be raised again with new evidence.

